WEBVTT

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:04.770
<i>Wealth, fame, power...</i>

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:06.670
<i>Gold Roger,
the King of the Pirates,</i>

00:00:06.670 --> 00:00:08.970
<i>attained everything
this world has to offer.</i>

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:12.840
<i>The words he uttered just before
his death drove people to the seas.</i>

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:16.680
<i>My treasure? If you want it,
you can have it!</i>

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:20.240
<i>Find it! I left everything
this world has to offer there!</i>

00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:27.590
<i>And so men head for the Grand Line
in pursuit of their dreams!</i>

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:31.490
<i>The world has truly entered
a Great Pirate Era!</i>

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:36.870
<i>We're going to gather up
all our dreams</i>

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:42.770
<i>and set out in search
of something to find</i>

00:00:42.770 --> 00:00:44.100
<i>ONE PIECE!</i>

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:54.620
<i>Compasses only cause delays</i>

00:00:54.620 --> 00:01:00.360
<i>Delirious with fever,
I take the helm</i>

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:10.350
<i>If the dusty treasure map has
been verified, it's not a legend!</i>

00:01:12.470 --> 00:01:18.170
<i>When it comes to personal storms,</i>

00:01:18.170 --> 00:01:23.480
<i>simply ride aboard
someone else's biorhythm</i>

00:01:23.480 --> 00:01:27.150
<i>and pretend it isn't there!</i>

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:32.650
<i>We're going to gather up
all our dreams</i>

00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:38.360
<i>and set out in search
of something to find</i>

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:44.600
<i>A coin in my pocket,
and do you wanna be my friend?</i>

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:49.970
<i>We are, We are on the cruise!</i>

00:01:49.970 --> 00:01:51.040
<i>We are!</i>

00:01:51.370 --> 00:01:55.710
Throw that gas mask away!

00:01:55.710 --> 00:02:00.010
You're no longer one of us.

00:02:01.320 --> 00:02:03.250
Die!

00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:10.890
I won't let you shoot poison gas!

00:02:10.890 --> 00:02:14.590
Stop scampering about, anchor boy!

00:02:25.340 --> 00:02:27.670
D-dammit!

00:02:28.840 --> 00:02:34.680
Ghin! You don't have to listen
to what that weakling says!

00:02:34.680 --> 00:02:37.850
I'm gonna kick his ass now!

00:02:37.850 --> 00:02:41.690
Don't mock Don Krieg!

00:02:41.690 --> 00:02:46.700
He's the strongest man.
You can't defeat him.

00:02:46.700 --> 00:02:51.370
Come to your senses, you idiot!
That man is trying to kill you!

00:02:51.370 --> 00:02:53.200
I deserve it...

00:02:53.200 --> 00:03:00.210
since I couldn't fulfill my role,
shamelessly losing to emotion...

00:03:00.210 --> 00:03:04.440
This is...
This is a well-deserved punishment!

00:03:05.650 --> 00:03:08.980
--Ghin!
--Why... Why?

00:03:08.980 --> 00:03:14.820
Ha! So you showed your pride
at the end... But it's too late.

00:03:14.820 --> 00:03:18.330
Die together with that cook!

00:03:18.330 --> 00:03:22.890
Deadly Poison Gas Bomb... M... H... 5!

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:34.070
<i>"I Won't Die!
Fierce Battle, Luffy vs. Krieg!"</i>

00:03:37.850 --> 00:03:40.680
--It's coming!!
--Dive into the sea!!

00:03:40.680 --> 00:03:43.050
Owner! Get inside the restaurant!!

00:03:46.190 --> 00:03:47.860
Let me borrow those.

00:03:47.860 --> 00:03:49.860
Sanji! Ghin! Use these!

00:03:49.860 --> 00:03:53.360
--Chore boy!
--Now for mine!

00:03:53.360 --> 00:03:56.990
Ahh! Everyone dived into the sea!

00:04:04.310 --> 00:04:07.740
Ahhh! What do I do?! What do I do?!
What do I do?! What do I do?!

00:04:07.740 --> 00:04:09.410
Huh?!

00:04:16.990 --> 00:04:20.220
This is force.

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:40.370
I... I'm saved... Good thing
I found that mask when I did...

00:04:45.350 --> 00:04:48.020
Wh-what a crazy bastard...

00:04:48.020 --> 00:04:51.020
I can't believe he used
poison gas in battle...

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:53.020
He's a devil...

00:04:53.020 --> 00:04:56.980
Yeah, no human being
would do something like that!

00:05:09.640 --> 00:05:11.970
Are Sanji and the chore boy okay?

00:05:11.970 --> 00:05:16.570
Not sure... Look!
The poison mist is clearing up!

00:05:25.990 --> 00:05:27.980
Ghin!

00:05:30.660 --> 00:05:32.660
Let go...

00:05:32.660 --> 00:05:35.660
Let go of the mask!

00:05:35.660 --> 00:05:38.960
--Ghin!
--Where's your mask?!

00:05:42.340 --> 00:05:46.340
Did you... give me your mask?

00:05:46.340 --> 00:05:48.070
Ghin!

00:05:49.340 --> 00:05:51.010
What an idiot.

00:05:51.010 --> 00:05:53.680
You're in pain right now
because you feel indebted

00:05:53.680 --> 00:05:55.680
just because someone
gave you some food.

00:05:55.680 --> 00:06:00.650
Well, I guess idiots
don't learn until they die...

00:06:04.960 --> 00:06:09.970
That bastard... even after he threw
the gas mask away as ordered...

00:06:09.970 --> 00:06:13.500
Is that how he talks
to his loyal subordinate?!

00:06:21.640 --> 00:06:25.600
Don... Don Krieg...

00:06:26.980 --> 00:06:28.970
Ghin...

00:06:33.150 --> 00:06:36.150
Ghin... It seems...

00:06:37.990 --> 00:06:42.950
It seems that you picked
the wrong man to follow...

00:06:46.500 --> 00:06:50.170
--So you're actually
sympathizing with that idiot scum?
--Scum?!

00:06:50.170 --> 00:06:55.580
That's right. An idiot who
loses sight of our goal

00:06:55.580 --> 00:06:58.180
and can't follow my orders
no longer holds value to me.

00:06:58.180 --> 00:07:01.650
There's no guarantee that
he won't betray me again.

00:07:01.650 --> 00:07:04.620
It's out of love that I put him out
of his misery now. Wouldn't you agree?

00:07:04.620 --> 00:07:09.290
I-I never imagined that Don would
actually kill the Chief Commander...

00:07:09.290 --> 00:07:12.260
C-can't be true...
There's no way he would!

00:07:12.260 --> 00:07:14.130
<i>Ghin-san is his right-hand man!</i>

00:07:14.130 --> 00:07:20.640
<i>That's right. No one has been more
faithful to Don than Ghin-san!</i>

00:07:20.640 --> 00:07:25.110
That time, too. When Fullbody's
Navy ship came after us

00:07:25.110 --> 00:07:28.140
right after we escaped
from the Grand Line...

00:07:28.140 --> 00:07:31.250
Yeah... He acted as
a decoy all by himself,

00:07:31.250 --> 00:07:34.150
pretending to be Don...

00:07:34.150 --> 00:07:38.320
He always risked his life
fighting for Don Krieg...

00:07:38.320 --> 00:07:41.950
I never imagined... that Don
would actually try to kill him...

00:07:45.160 --> 00:07:48.660
--How evil...
--Patty! We have an antidote, don't we?!

00:07:48.660 --> 00:07:53.000
Yeah, we do...
but that's for food poisoning.

00:07:53.000 --> 00:07:55.170
It doesn't matter what it is,
just bring it over here!

00:07:55.170 --> 00:07:59.170
Idiot! If you wanna save him,
put the mask on him right away!

00:07:59.170 --> 00:08:01.940
It should have some sort
of detoxifying effect!

00:08:01.940 --> 00:08:05.110
Bring him to the second floor
and let him breathe well.

00:08:05.110 --> 00:08:08.780
If there's a chance to save him,
that's the only way!

00:08:08.780 --> 00:08:11.120
Hurry up, Patty! Carne!

00:08:11.120 --> 00:08:13.120
All right already!

00:08:13.120 --> 00:08:15.790
Me too?!

00:08:15.790 --> 00:08:21.630
Ha! It's no use. Even if he stays alive,
it'll be an hour at most...

00:08:22.960 --> 00:08:26.060
Don't you dare die, Ghin.

00:08:27.970 --> 00:08:31.630
Don't let someone like him kill you!

00:08:32.770 --> 00:08:37.810
Cling to life! Got that?!
I'll kick his ass for you!

00:08:37.810 --> 00:08:43.320
D-don't. You can't... defeat him...

00:08:43.320 --> 00:08:45.750
Cool down! Attacking head-on

00:08:45.750 --> 00:08:48.660
would be playing right
into his hands. You'll die!

00:08:50.830 --> 00:08:53.330
I won't die.

00:08:53.330 --> 00:08:56.330
--Go ahead and shoot
as much as you want.
--Hey!

00:08:56.330 --> 00:09:01.600
Such a fool... The easiest enemy
to kill is one who's in a frenzy.

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:06.440
The sea is your hell, anchor boy.
You're heading towards...

00:09:06.440 --> 00:09:08.110
--Here comes...
--Bombs!

00:09:08.110 --> 00:09:09.780
...your graveyard!

00:09:09.780 --> 00:09:12.210
My graveyard?!

00:09:16.380 --> 00:09:19.450
Oh, no! Get out of there, chore boy!

00:09:20.960 --> 00:09:22.950
He got hit!

00:09:27.300 --> 00:09:29.630
He's dead...

00:09:29.630 --> 00:09:31.400
Chore boy...

00:09:35.300 --> 00:09:38.640
--You little...
--Gum-Gum...

00:09:38.640 --> 00:09:40.480
Hit me...

00:09:40.480 --> 00:09:43.040
--Here it comes!
--...if you can!

00:09:43.040 --> 00:09:45.170
How dirty! That's...

00:09:47.650 --> 00:09:50.150
Pistol!!

00:09:50.150 --> 00:09:52.520
What?!

00:10:21.520 --> 00:10:24.190
Don Krieg got beaten!

00:10:24.190 --> 00:10:26.490
What the hell is he?!

00:10:26.490 --> 00:10:28.690
He hit him along with the porcupine!

00:10:28.690 --> 00:10:31.180
Ouch...

00:10:32.690 --> 00:10:35.360
Holy shit...

00:10:35.360 --> 00:10:39.700
We've never even seen
Don brought to his knees...

00:10:39.700 --> 00:10:44.040
He hit Don in his face! And he did it
through that Porcupine Cape!

00:10:44.040 --> 00:10:47.530
C... Can you believe that?!

00:10:54.380 --> 00:10:59.050
Is this... my graveyard?

00:10:59.050 --> 00:11:04.250
Or... your graveyard?

00:11:06.330 --> 00:11:12.230
My... graveyard?!

00:11:24.010 --> 00:11:31.390
Don't think... you can send me
to my grave with stuff like this.

00:11:33.020 --> 00:11:37.320
I'm not gonna die here.

00:11:59.050 --> 00:12:02.710
He's crazy...

00:12:05.650 --> 00:12:08.990
You see idiots like that
every once in a while...

00:12:08.990 --> 00:12:15.330
ones who will fight to the death
once they've set their eyes on a target...

00:12:15.330 --> 00:12:19.330
Fight... to the death...

00:12:19.330 --> 00:12:23.800
You're in trouble if someone
like that becomes your enemy.

00:12:25.840 --> 00:12:35.840
But you know, win or lose,
I like guys like him...

00:13:10.990 --> 00:13:13.390
--Hey, underling!
--Hang in there!

00:13:13.390 --> 00:13:16.820
Now, breathe!
Breathe in a lot of good air!

00:13:16.820 --> 00:13:21.990
Are you all right? Hey!
Do you want to drink some water? Hey!

00:13:24.670 --> 00:13:26.000
This isn't good.

00:13:26.000 --> 00:13:28.670
Do you wanna eat my
special pudding? It's good!

00:13:28.670 --> 00:13:32.340
Idiot! You want to feed poison
to a poisoned man?!

00:13:32.340 --> 00:13:35.680
Hey, what do you mean by poison?!
You're one to talk!

00:13:35.680 --> 00:13:39.350
What'd you say?! People say my meat
dishes are the best in the world!

00:13:39.350 --> 00:13:42.150
They're considered so delicious
that people think they're in heaven.

00:13:42.150 --> 00:13:46.120
--Ahh! You can't die on us!
--Hey! C'mon! Don't die, underling!

00:13:46.120 --> 00:13:50.020
A-are you dead? Are you really dead?!
Hey! Really? Are you dead?

00:13:50.020 --> 00:13:51.690
Hey! Are you dead? Really?
Are you really dead?!

00:13:51.690 --> 00:13:53.690
Shut up!!

00:13:56.360 --> 00:13:59.370
Phew, he's still alive...

00:13:59.370 --> 00:14:06.870
D... Don Krieg... Is Don Krieg...

00:14:09.310 --> 00:14:12.310
Wh-what's gonna happen to this fight?

00:14:12.310 --> 00:14:14.320
Idiot! That was just dumb luck!

00:14:14.320 --> 00:14:19.990
There's no way Don would be defeated
by a stupid brat like that! Don't worry!

00:14:19.990 --> 00:14:22.320
Chore boy...

00:14:26.330 --> 00:14:32.030
"I'm not gonna die here," you said?

00:14:34.340 --> 00:14:40.610
If you won't die here... then...

00:14:40.610 --> 00:14:44.350
...who the hell will?!

00:14:44.350 --> 00:14:46.440
You will, right?!

00:14:47.650 --> 00:14:50.350
You will!!

00:14:56.690 --> 00:15:01.960
Don got beaten again!
What the hell is going on?!

00:15:01.960 --> 00:15:07.970
E-enemies are supposed to die
without even touching Don Krieg...

00:15:07.970 --> 00:15:12.410
Don's supposed to be
invincible... What the...

00:15:13.470 --> 00:15:16.640
What the hell is that brat?!

00:15:29.990 --> 00:15:32.660
He's really good!

00:15:32.660 --> 00:15:35.160
Yeah... I'm blown away...

00:15:35.160 --> 00:15:38.000
--He's amazing!
--Get Krieg!

00:15:38.000 --> 00:15:40.230
Yeah, he can do it!

00:15:40.230 --> 00:15:43.670
That brat is fighting Don
at his level, without a doubt...

00:15:43.670 --> 00:15:46.840
This isn't a dream, right? Don getting
beaten by someone like him...

00:15:46.840 --> 00:15:48.680
Don's supposed to be invincible...

00:15:48.680 --> 00:15:51.680
As it stands, the legend of
Don Krieg the strongest will be...

00:15:51.680 --> 00:15:55.140
Stop talking nonsense!!

00:16:03.290 --> 00:16:05.630
What the...

00:16:05.630 --> 00:16:09.960
F... Finally, Don Krieg's
strongest weapon...

00:16:09.960 --> 00:16:12.800
The Mighty Battle Spear!

00:16:12.800 --> 00:16:15.640
What's that? It exploded.

00:16:15.640 --> 00:16:19.970
Now... I'll see how long you
can keep avoiding this...

00:16:19.970 --> 00:16:23.140
It'll be a sight, anchor boy.

00:16:23.140 --> 00:16:27.650
That puny spear from earlier still
left you standing after a few attacks,

00:16:27.650 --> 00:16:32.150
but this Mighty Battle Spear
is different.

00:16:32.150 --> 00:16:35.020
As soon as you touch it,
you'll be blown to pieces!!

00:16:36.990 --> 00:16:39.320
Wh-what's with that spear?!

00:16:40.330 --> 00:16:42.830
I'll fall, I'll fall, I'll fall...

00:16:42.830 --> 00:16:44.770
Wh-what's with that spear?

00:16:44.770 --> 00:16:49.000
It explodes every time
he strikes it down?

00:16:49.000 --> 00:16:51.600
What? My knees...

00:16:53.340 --> 00:16:55.340
A long battle will be trouble...

00:16:55.340 --> 00:16:59.350
He's shed too much blood...
He's not gonna last long...

00:16:59.350 --> 00:17:01.620
Your overdoing it has
taken its toll on you.

00:17:01.620 --> 00:17:05.120
You must be reaching your limit...

00:17:05.120 --> 00:17:08.060
Darn! With the foothold
rocking like this,

00:17:08.060 --> 00:17:11.460
I can't fight with full power.
I'm stumped.

00:17:11.790 --> 00:17:16.300
That Mighty Battle Spear
never ceases to amaze me.

00:17:16.300 --> 00:17:20.600
Yeah. The stronger that
big spear is struck down,

00:17:20.600 --> 00:17:22.770
the bigger the explosion it causes.

00:17:22.770 --> 00:17:27.070
It's something that no one
other than Don can handle!

00:17:32.480 --> 00:17:35.350
But how powerful he is...

00:17:35.350 --> 00:17:38.090
To think he easily swings around
that super heavy spear,

00:17:38.090 --> 00:17:42.320
which weighs 1ton with
those two shoulder guards!

00:17:42.320 --> 00:17:47.730
That's exactly the reason
why Don is the strongest!

00:17:52.170 --> 00:17:55.730
--Wooaahhh...
--Take this!

00:17:58.510 --> 00:18:01.010
Die!!

00:18:01.010 --> 00:18:03.610
Chore boy!

00:18:03.610 --> 00:18:06.950
Phew... That was close...

00:18:09.950 --> 00:18:13.620
You... damn caterpillar!!

00:18:13.620 --> 00:18:17.580
Waaahhh!

00:18:24.130 --> 00:18:26.290
Chore boy!!

00:18:42.980 --> 00:18:46.320
--Chore boy...
--Are you all right?!

00:18:46.320 --> 00:18:49.320
Ha! I'm not quite done yet...

00:18:49.320 --> 00:18:54.790
You made me angry.
I won't let you die so easily.

00:19:01.600 --> 00:19:06.610
Dammit! That bastard Krieg brings
out weapons one after another...

00:19:06.610 --> 00:19:08.610
There's no way that chore boy can...

00:19:08.610 --> 00:19:12.150
Even if hundreds of
weapons are built in,

00:19:12.150 --> 00:19:17.780
he can be defeated by someone
with a spear of blind determination.

00:19:34.970 --> 00:19:37.870
Hmph! How easy...

00:19:49.650 --> 00:19:52.880
Now that makes you worth crushing...

00:20:05.000 --> 00:20:07.840
Life or death...

00:20:07.840 --> 00:20:13.670
In a pirate battle, if you fear death
for even a moment, you'll fall to pieces.

00:20:13.670 --> 00:20:15.180
What're you talking about?

00:20:15.180 --> 00:20:17.670
At least...

00:20:27.690 --> 00:20:30.090
At least...

00:20:32.690 --> 00:20:38.500
...that kid doesn't have any hesitation!

00:20:50.380 --> 00:20:53.680
Is it a survival instinct?

00:20:55.550 --> 00:20:59.320
Or does he not fear death
because he has faith in himself?

00:21:01.460 --> 00:21:03.650
Faith...

00:21:14.670 --> 00:21:18.800
Y... You son of a bitch!!

00:21:23.840 --> 00:21:27.980
--Alright! You're amazing!
--Chore boy! Go for it!!
--Get him!

00:21:30.020 --> 00:21:35.750
I told you... that this is where you die!!

00:21:38.030 --> 00:21:42.620
I am the strongest man!!

00:21:51.370 --> 00:21:55.080
The fleet Krieg gathered...
His hundreds of weapons and poison...

00:21:55.080 --> 00:21:58.570
If they're all force...

00:22:01.980 --> 00:22:08.160
then that kid's spear is also force...

00:22:08.160 --> 00:22:12.330
The spear held in his heart...

00:22:12.330 --> 00:22:19.930
I know an idiot who's holding back
that spear for a stupid reason...

00:22:29.180 --> 00:22:33.910
M-my Mighty Battle Spear is...
What the hell did you do?!

00:22:40.520 --> 00:22:43.690
I gave it five punches.

00:22:43.690 --> 00:22:47.320
I guess that's it for your spear.

00:22:50.200 --> 00:22:52.330
Prepare yourself...

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:06.070
<i>When I was little, I had
a vision of a treasure map</i>

00:23:10.280 --> 00:23:17.220
<i>and I always searched
for that miraculous place</i>

00:23:17.220 --> 00:23:24.390
<i>before someone else could
beat me to it</i>

00:23:27.000 --> 00:23:37.000
<i>If the world is going to change</i>

00:23:38.480 --> 00:23:45.490
<i>before I can even attain my dream</i>

00:23:45.490 --> 00:23:52.560
<i>then take me to the time
when I knew nothing</i>

00:23:52.560 --> 00:24:02.560
<i>so that my memories won't fade</i>
